# auto-review 2026-10-09: corrected
#: appGUI/preferences/general/GeneralAppPrefGroupUI.py:159
msgid ""
"Set the log level.\n"
"Values:\n"
"0 -> logging is disabled\n"
"1 -> logging is done only in console\n"
"2 -> verbose logging with messages in the Tcl Shell\n"
"Require restart."
msgstr ""
"Kayıt düzeyini ayarlayın.\n"
"Değerler:\n"
"0 -> kayıt tutulmaz\n"
